  - m_Id: 8312222965219328
    m_Localized: "Y\u0131k\u0131labilir chunk"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12711559031865344
    m_Localized: VARSAYILAN OLARAK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13057984500514816
    m_Localized: "CHUNK T\xDCRLER\u0130"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13057887209439232
    m_Localized: "Tan\u0131mlamas\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13057949494853632
    m_Localized: "Seviyede ard\u0131\u015F\u0131k olarak ka\xE7 adet \"chunk\" (b\xF6l\xFCm)
      yer alaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 belirler.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13058096987553792
    m_Localized: "Be\u015F t\xFCr chunk vard\u0131r:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Temel chunk \u2013
      d\xFC\u015Fmanlar ve tuzaklar i\xE7eren bir chunk.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Tavanl\u0131
      chunk \u2013 tavan ve \xFCzerinde tuzaklar bulunan bir chunk.\r\n\r\n\u2022
      Izgara platform chunk \u2013 oyuncunun \xFCzerinden atlad\u0131\u011F\u0131
      platformlar i\xE7eren bir chunk.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Hareketli platform chunk \u2013
      birbirine yakla\u015Fan hareketli platformlar i\xE7eren bir chunk.\r\n\r\n\u2022
      Y\u0131k\u0131labilir chunk \u2013 \xE7\xF6ken bir zemine sahip bir chunk."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13058139958198272
    m_Localized: "Her bir chunk t\xFCr\xFCn\xFCn 0.00 ile 1.00 aras\u0131nda bir
      a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131k de\u011Feri vard\u0131r (temel chunk i\xE7in minimum
      0.3't\xFCr). Her yeni chunk i\xE7in oyun, t\xFCm a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131k de\u011Ferlerinin
      toplam\u0131n\u0131 al\u0131r ve bir chunk t\xFCr\xFCn\xFC, onun pay\u0131yla
      orant\u0131l\u0131 olarak se\xE7er.\r\n\r\n\xD6rne\u011Fin, Temel = 0.8, Tavanl\u0131
      = 0.4 ve di\u011Ferleri = 0.2 ise, olas\u0131l\u0131klar \u015F\xF6yledir:\r\n%44
      \u2013 Temel, %22 \u2013 Tavanl\u0131, %11'er \u2013 di\u011Ferleri."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13442591293095936
    m_Localized: BLOK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25319826467766272
